rejects passing std::string through it. Master already sizes the
virtio request buffer at compile time, so the VLA hunk of the
0_p20251025 patch is not needed here.
--- a/src/shim/hwq.cpp
+++ b/src/shim/hwq.cpp
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
